## Does order matter? [Thm 1.4]{.tag}

Swap two chosen items. If the result is a different outcome, count arrangements. If it is the same outcome, count combinations.

| Choose 3 of 10 candidates for… | Order | Count |
|---|---|---|
| gold, silver, bronze | matters: arrangements | $10\cdot9\cdot8=720$ |
| a project team | does not matter: combinations | $\binom{10}{3}=120$ |

. . .

Check: $720/3!=120$. Every team of 3 can be arranged in $3!=6$ medal orders.

